<title>JAPAN: Taiyo Ink -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Taiyo Ink -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.49		vs	    5.08</p>
<p> Operating	  872    million    vs	  569    million</p>
<p> Current	    927    million    vs	  623    million</p>
<p> Net		  517    million    vs	  302    million</p>
<p> EPS		   55.62 yen	  vs	   32.51 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   9 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 15.00 yen	  vs	    9.70 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Taiyo Ink Mfg Co Ltd is a leading maker of inks for printed circuit boards.</p>
</text>
